# Local key material is supplied to containers via runtime volume mounts, never the build
# context. Keep secrets/ and certs/ out so a `COPY . .` (used by the dev images) can never bake
# the licensing private key, bootstrap token, or dev PFX into an image layer.
**/secrets
**/certs
LICENSE
README.md
